 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The reflective verbs",
   "texto": [
    "As in Spanish («I'm up.»), many verbs of the routine have a pronoun in front of them: **je me lève** (I stand up), **je me douche** (I shower), **je me couche** (I lie down).",
    "In front of vowel, **me** loses the e: **je m'habille** (I'm dressed), **je m'appelle**.",
    "In a negative phrase, **ne** goes before the reflective pronoun and **pas** after the verb: **Je ne me couche pas tard** (I don't lie down late)."
   ]
  },
