  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The parts of the day",
   "texto": [
    "**Le matin** (morning), **l'après-midi** (afternoon), **le soir** (afternoon or evening, depending on the time), **la nuit** (evening). To indicate when something happens, they are usually used without preposition.",
    "Meals: **le petit déjeuner** (breakfast), **le déjeuner** (noon food), **le dîner** (dinner). And its verbs: **déjeuner** (lunch at noon) and **dîner** (dinner).",
    "**Tous les jours** = every day. **Tôt** = early. **Tard** = late."
   ]
